1
00:01:07,760 --> 00:01:08,359
Sir.

2
00:01:08,439 --> 00:01:09,200
Please wait a moment.

3
00:01:09,359 --> 00:01:10,400
The report will be ready shortly.

4
00:01:25,879 --> 00:01:26,359
Damn it.

5
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:28,439
We fell for a diversionary tactic.

6
00:01:28,920 --> 00:01:29,560
Hurry back to the hospital.

7
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:31,439
The lab report might've been stolen.

8
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:32,719
Wait for me!

9
00:01:35,040 --> 00:01:35,400
Doctor!

10
00:01:37,239 --> 00:01:37,680
Where's the doctor?

11
00:01:40,760 --> 00:01:41,920
Dr. Lu was drugged.

12
00:01:42,079 --> 00:01:42,879
They're treating him right now.

13
00:01:43,280 --> 00:01:43,840
What?

14
00:01:44,680 --> 00:01:46,239
What about Mr. Li's toxicology report?

15
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:50,040
Why is it missing?

16
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:51,400
I remember he wrote it.

17
00:01:51,719 --> 00:01:53,280
And the bracelet, it was tested too.

18
00:01:54,680 --> 00:01:55,400
Bracelet?

19
00:01:56,200 --> 00:01:56,799
What bracelet?

20
00:01:57,599 --> 00:01:58,319
Dr. Lu said

21
00:01:58,359 --> 00:02:00,000
he needed to test everything on the victim

22
00:02:00,120 --> 00:02:01,159
to pinpoint the source of the poison.

23
00:02:01,319 --> 00:02:02,879
Mr. Li was wearing a beaded bracelet.

24
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:04,159
It was sent for testing too.

25
00:02:05,879 --> 00:02:07,000
This is the bag for the bracelet.

26
00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:11,800
Aconitine.

27
00:02:13,680 --> 00:02:14,599
On this bracelet...

28
00:02:15,319 --> 00:02:16,400
there is highly toxic aconitine.

29
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:18,479
The bracelet...

30
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:21,120
Wear it, it'll keep you safe.

31
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:23,719
I remember now.

32
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:25,680
It belongs to that old witch.

33
00:02:28,879 --> 00:02:30,479
I shouldn't have let that old witch go.

34
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:31,759
Let's go to the Spirit Medium's house.

35
00:02:31,879 --> 00:02:32,280
Okay.

36
00:02:42,199 --> 00:02:44,080
I was ordered by Mr. Li

37
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:46,639
to kidnap Old Ding's grandson, Xiaobao,

38
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:48,800
and drown him as a human foundation sacrifice.

39
00:02:49,439 --> 00:02:50,039
These past few days,

40
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:51,680
I've been having nightmares every day.

41
00:02:52,639 --> 00:02:54,159
I dreamt of Xiaobao coming for me.

42
00:02:54,759 --> 00:02:55,400
He said

43
00:02:56,319 --> 00:02:57,520
he wants me to pay with my life.

44
00:02:57,919 --> 00:02:59,599
You took a life.

45
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:01,919
The burden of your sins is too heavy.

46
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:04,960
You're haunted by Xiaobao's evil spirit.

47
00:03:05,439 --> 00:03:06,280
Then what should I do?

48
00:03:06,879 --> 00:03:08,479
How can I drive the evil spirit away?

49
00:03:08,879 --> 00:03:09,520
Spirit Medium,

50
00:03:09,879 --> 00:03:10,759
please help me.

51
00:03:22,159 --> 00:03:25,159
I'll perform Spirit Summoning with Rice.

52
00:03:26,080 --> 00:03:28,199
I will invite Xiaobao's soul into my body.

53
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:30,400
You will apologize to him personally,

54
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:31,800
and beg for his forgiveness.

55
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:33,960
If Xiaobao forgives you,

56
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:36,919
he won't haunt you anymore.

57
00:03:37,240 --> 00:03:37,759
Okay.

58
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:38,879
I'll do as you say.

59
00:03:39,560 --> 00:03:40,840
I will apologize to Xiaobao.

60
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:43,639
Spirit Summoning with Rice is perilous.

61
00:03:43,759 --> 00:03:45,159
It trades a soul for a soul.

62
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:46,159
Therefore,

63
00:03:46,479 --> 00:03:47,919
while I am casting the spell,

64
00:03:48,599 --> 00:03:50,039
the candles in this room

65
00:03:50,479 --> 00:03:51,479
must not go out.

66
00:03:51,759 --> 00:03:53,319
The candle flame is the Soul-Guiding Lamp.

67
00:03:53,719 --> 00:03:54,520
If the lamp goes out

68
00:03:54,879 --> 00:03:56,080
while Xiaobao's soul

69
00:03:56,159 --> 00:03:57,520
is possessing my body,

70
00:03:57,719 --> 00:03:59,560
his soul can't return to the underworld,

71
00:03:59,639 --> 00:04:01,280
and my soul won't be able to come back.

72
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:02,400
Do you understand?

73
00:04:02,759 --> 00:04:03,280
Yes.

74
00:04:03,639 --> 00:04:04,879
I will definitely protect the candles

75
00:04:05,240 --> 00:04:06,560
so the Soul-Guiding Lamp doesn't go out.

76
00:04:15,039 --> 00:04:17,360
There is a path to heaven,

77
00:04:18,839 --> 00:04:20,920
and a door to the underworld.

78
00:04:25,160 --> 00:04:29,000
White rice paves the way to the netherworld.

79
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:33,879
Where is the soul of Ding Xiaobao?

80
00:04:40,079 --> 00:04:42,040
With white rice as the medium

81
00:04:42,439 --> 00:04:44,040
and the spirit lamp as the guide,

82
00:04:44,519 --> 00:04:46,399
Ding Xiaobao,

83
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:50,600
Three Ethereal Souls and Seven Mortal Forms, possess me!

84
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:51,759
Come! Come!

85
00:04:52,199 --> 00:04:52,680
Come!

86
00:04:52,759 --> 00:04:53,319
Come!

87
00:04:53,439 --> 00:04:54,639
Come!

88
00:05:00,160 --> 00:05:00,800
Spirit Medium?

89
00:05:01,360 --> 00:05:02,120
What's wrong, Spirit Medium?

90
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:03,319
Spirit Medium?

91
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:05,360
Spirit Medium?

92
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:09,360
This candle absolutely cannot go out!

93
00:05:09,480 --> 00:05:11,199
Otherwise, the dead soul can't go back!

94
00:05:11,839 --> 00:05:12,319
Don't move.

95
00:05:17,319 --> 00:05:17,879
You she-devil!

96
00:05:18,399 --> 00:05:19,639
You really are a reincarnated Rakshasa.

97
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:21,079
Death follows you wherever you go.

98
00:05:22,079 --> 00:05:22,879
This is too freaky!

99
00:05:23,879 --> 00:05:25,079
An evil spirit really is claiming lives!

100
00:05:27,439 --> 00:05:28,160
This smell...

101
00:05:30,959 --> 00:05:31,560
Was it you?

102
00:05:31,920 --> 00:05:32,600
Come back to the police station with me.

103
00:05:32,959 --> 00:05:33,199
No.

104
00:05:33,199 --> 00:05:33,720
Don't touch him!

105
00:05:34,439 --> 00:05:35,199
His hands are poisoned!

106
00:05:35,959 --> 00:05:36,519
What poison?

107
00:05:36,839 --> 00:05:37,399
Aconitine.

108
00:05:38,439 --> 00:05:39,639
The newspaper had this smell too.

109
00:05:43,199 --> 00:05:43,759
The killer

110
00:05:45,199 --> 00:05:46,959
used ink containing aconitine

111
00:05:47,279 --> 00:05:48,399
to print on the newspaper.

112
00:05:49,079 --> 00:05:50,839
Aconitine is extremely toxic.

113
00:05:51,480 --> 00:05:52,240
A single drop is fatal.

114
00:05:52,959 --> 00:05:54,759
The Spirit Medium got poison on her hands.

115
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:56,759
Her finger was cut,

116
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:58,680
and the poison entered her bloodstream,

117
00:05:59,120 --> 00:05:59,879
causing her death.

118
00:06:02,480 --> 00:06:03,040
I understand.

119
00:06:04,560 --> 00:06:05,720
Go wash the poison off and change.

120
00:06:06,680 --> 00:06:07,800
Okay, I'll go wash right now.

121
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:08,560
You go back to the police station first

122
00:06:08,839 --> 00:06:09,600
and take the body with you.

123
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:10,600
I'll investigate further.

124
00:06:11,079 --> 00:06:11,439
All right.

125
00:06:24,439 --> 00:06:25,079
What's wrong?

126
00:06:28,279 --> 00:06:29,399
Bro Xun is allergic to cat hair.

127
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:31,720
It seems this room

128
00:06:32,519 --> 00:06:33,160
used to have a cat.

129
00:06:40,360 --> 00:06:40,800
Look.

130
00:06:42,040 --> 00:06:42,800
I was right, wasn't I?

131
00:06:45,120 --> 00:06:45,639
A cat.

132
00:06:49,079 --> 00:06:50,680
The night Mengzhu died,

133
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:52,879
a cat also appeared in the Li Manor.

134
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:56,680
The miss was bitten by a cat as a child,

135
00:06:56,720 --> 00:06:57,600
and was terrified of them.

136
00:06:58,839 --> 00:07:01,000
The Master forbade keeping cats in the manor.

137
00:07:01,360 --> 00:07:02,040
But that day,

138
00:07:02,160 --> 00:07:03,680
the Spirit Medium brought a cat inside.

139
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:07,800
Father,

140
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:09,680
I want to swap rooms with you.

141
00:07:12,439 --> 00:07:13,439
So that means

142
00:07:14,639 --> 00:07:17,920
the Spirit Medium purposely brought the cat.

143
00:07:18,480 --> 00:07:19,279
Her goal was

144
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:21,439
to scare her with the cat at night.

145
00:07:22,839 --> 00:07:23,680
Mengzhu was afraid of cats,

146
00:07:24,319 --> 00:07:26,120
so she swapped rooms with Mr. Li.

147
00:07:26,720 --> 00:07:27,279
As a result,

148
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:29,879
she became the scapegoat in the puppet murder.

149
00:07:30,399 --> 00:07:31,639
And who is this man

150
00:07:32,279 --> 00:07:33,399
in the photo with the Spirit Medium?

151
00:07:44,439 --> 00:07:44,879
Look.

152
00:07:46,480 --> 00:07:47,879
And this All-In-One Restorative Pill.

153
00:07:49,519 --> 00:07:50,759
I've seen this bottle before.

154
00:07:51,519 --> 00:07:53,240
That day, the Spirit Medium came to see the Master.

155
00:07:56,120 --> 00:07:56,639
Master.

156
00:07:57,079 --> 00:07:59,399
This is the All-In-One Restorative Pill I made.

157
00:07:59,839 --> 00:08:01,519
It wards off evil and restores vitality.

158
00:08:01,920 --> 00:08:02,639
Hurry and take it.

159
00:08:15,959 --> 00:08:16,720
Hurry up and take it.

160
00:08:30,680 --> 00:08:32,240
After taking the Spirit Medium's pill,

161
00:08:32,519 --> 00:08:33,480
the Master suffered from internal heat,

162
00:08:33,759 --> 00:08:34,879
and got blisters all over his mouth.

163
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:40,600
Right.

164
00:08:41,559 --> 00:08:42,639
Chunmei and her brother

165
00:08:43,600 --> 00:08:45,440
wanted to poison Master Li with tea.

166
00:08:46,399 --> 00:08:47,080
But the Spirit Medium

167
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:49,159
used the All-In-One Restorative Pill early

168
00:08:49,519 --> 00:08:51,120
to give Master Li mouth ulcers,

169
00:08:51,759 --> 00:08:52,600
so he couldn't drink hot tea,

170
00:08:53,200 --> 00:08:54,120
thus escaping disaster.

171
00:08:54,440 --> 00:08:55,120
Master,

172
00:08:56,519 --> 00:08:58,480
this Spirit Medium really has some skills.

173
00:08:58,759 --> 00:09:00,120
She can even predict the future.

174
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:03,480
Later,

175
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:08,039
the day the chandelier crushed Second Madam,

176
00:09:08,679 --> 00:09:10,960
they'd agreed to try on suits at the firm.

177
00:09:11,559 --> 00:09:12,960
I have a big deal.

178
00:09:13,279 --> 00:09:14,600
I can only discuss it with you.

179
00:09:16,440 --> 00:09:17,360
Master, this is bad!

180
00:09:17,559 --> 00:09:18,440
The Second Madam is dead!

181
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:19,080
What?

182
00:09:19,759 --> 00:09:21,279
The mysterious big client

183
00:09:21,840 --> 00:09:24,240
went to buy the book from Mr. Li,

184
00:09:24,840 --> 00:09:26,759
which delayed his return home,

185
00:09:27,360 --> 00:09:28,360
saving him for the third time.

186
00:09:30,320 --> 00:09:30,720
Right.

187
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:32,960
When Third Madam was by the well,

188
00:09:33,240 --> 00:09:35,639
the night she was poisoned singing opera,

189
00:09:37,279 --> 00:09:38,039
where was Mr. Li?

190
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:42,879
The Master went to the Spirit Medium's house.

191
00:09:43,480 --> 00:09:44,159
Master Li,

192
00:09:44,559 --> 00:09:46,000
I see a dark aura on your forehead.

193
00:09:46,320 --> 00:09:48,080
I fear you will face a bloody disaster soon.

194
00:09:49,039 --> 00:09:50,720
Why isn't the Master back yet?

195
00:09:51,200 --> 00:09:52,200
I agreed with him

196
00:09:52,440 --> 00:09:53,440
that after singing Cinnabar Well,

197
00:09:53,600 --> 00:09:55,759
we would go to Cuixiang Restaurant for dinner.

198
00:09:57,759 --> 00:09:58,360
Spirit Medium,

199
00:09:58,960 --> 00:09:59,720
I made plans with my wife.

200
00:09:59,840 --> 00:10:00,960
I'm going to hear her sing opera.

201
00:10:01,039 --> 00:10:01,759
I should go back first.

202
00:10:01,960 --> 00:10:02,679
Let's talk another day.

203
00:10:03,399 --> 00:10:04,519
You absolutely cannot leave.

204
00:10:04,759 --> 00:10:06,399
I'll perform an exorcism ritual for you now.

205
00:10:10,159 --> 00:10:12,000
Spirits of heaven and earth,

206
00:10:12,200 --> 00:10:14,720
Taishang Laojun, teach me to slay demons!

207
00:10:14,759 --> 00:10:15,440
Madam, what's wrong?

208
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:16,799
Somebody!

209
00:10:17,360 --> 00:10:18,120
Somebody, help!

210
00:10:18,240 --> 00:10:19,200
What demon dare not submit?

211
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:21,080
What ghost dare stand in my way?

212
00:10:21,279 --> 00:10:22,000
So,

213
00:10:22,679 --> 00:10:24,240
the expert behind Mr. Li

214
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:25,480
is the Spirit Medium.

215
00:10:28,600 --> 00:10:29,639
Then tell me, why did the Spirit Medium

216
00:10:30,480 --> 00:10:31,840
want to help Mr. Li?

217
00:10:32,799 --> 00:10:34,519
It was for your family heirloom, of course.

218
00:10:35,399 --> 00:10:37,120
Mr. Li hid the book.

219
00:10:37,559 --> 00:10:38,399
If he died,

220
00:10:38,679 --> 00:10:39,519
the book would never be found.

221
00:10:40,960 --> 00:10:41,480
Jiang Huai,

222
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:43,240
that book of yours,

223
00:10:43,720 --> 00:10:44,720
what exactly is written in it?

224
00:10:45,639 --> 00:10:46,519
Heavenly Craftsmanship

225
00:10:47,039 --> 00:10:49,399
records hundreds of ancient crafting methods.

226
00:10:50,200 --> 00:10:52,399
There are many wicked people in the world

227
00:10:52,600 --> 00:10:53,759
who are desperate to get it.

228
00:10:53,759 --> 00:10:54,679
So you're saying,

229
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:56,480
to get the book, the Spirit Medium

230
00:10:56,840 --> 00:10:58,720
painstakingly set up this trap.

231
00:11:00,039 --> 00:11:01,720
But she was afraid of being exposed,

232
00:11:02,840 --> 00:11:04,159
so she poisoned Mr. Li.

233
00:11:04,279 --> 00:11:07,000
If the Spirit Medium wanted to poison Mr. Li,

234
00:11:07,399 --> 00:11:08,080
then why did she

235
00:11:08,080 --> 00:11:09,600
also poison herself?

236
00:11:11,840 --> 00:11:12,399
True.

237
00:11:14,759 --> 00:11:15,960
But here at the Spirit Medium's place,

238
00:11:16,639 --> 00:11:18,320
we didn't see Heavenly Craftsmanship either.

239
00:11:19,159 --> 00:11:20,440
Which means she didn't get the book.

240
00:11:21,720 --> 00:11:22,279
Master,

241
00:11:22,840 --> 00:11:23,679
look at this bowl.

242
00:11:24,360 --> 00:11:25,159
Is there anything special about it?

243
00:11:31,519 --> 00:11:32,240
This bowl

244
00:11:33,120 --> 00:11:35,039
dates back to the Yanbei warlord era.

245
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:38,600
What's the Spirit Medium's real background?

246
00:11:40,039 --> 00:11:43,080
The Spirit Medium fled here from Yanbei.

247
00:11:43,879 --> 00:11:45,240
There are few outsiders in Li Town.

248
00:11:45,919 --> 00:11:47,759
As for those in town with a Yanbei accent,

249
00:11:48,399 --> 00:11:49,200
there is one other person.

250
00:11:49,840 --> 00:11:50,840
He's from her hometown.

251
00:11:51,399 --> 00:11:52,120
From her hometown?

252
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:53,240
Who is it?

253
00:11:54,039 --> 00:11:54,399
It's...
